  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Roughly chop tomato.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66026eb2b8d1e1d58ab30ce6-47a547b3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook sliced mushrooms and tomato, stirring occasionally, until tender, 4-5 minutes.\n• Add Mediterranean seasoning and garlic paste and cook until fragrant, 1-2 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66026eb2b8d1e1d58ab30ce6-839679b1.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add the boiling water (13/4 cups for 2 people / 31/2 cups for 4 people), orecchiette, light cooking cream and vegetable stock powder. Stir to combine and bring to the boil.\n• Reduce heat to medium and cover with a lid. Cook, stirring occasionally, until the pasta is 'al dente', 10 minutes.\n• Once the pasta is cooked, stir in baby spinach leaves, basil pesto and Parmesan cheese. Season to taste. TIP: 'Al dente' pasta is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66026eb2b8d1e1d58ab30ce6-d81e24c3.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide one-pot basil pesto and mushroom pasta between bowls.\n• Sprinkle with flaked almonds to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66026eb2b8d1e1d58ab30ce6-cfa6278c.jpeg"
    }
  ]
